## Anatomy

<CodeBlock code={anatomy} filename="App.svelte" />

## API reference

### OtpField.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

### OtpField.Input

<ApiTable props={inputProps} />

The first segment carries `autocomplete="one-time-code"` for mobile SMS autofill. Pair with `Field` and a length-checking `validate` for required codes.

## Keyboard interactions

- Typing a character commits it and advances; <Kbd>←</Kbd><Kbd>→</Kbd> move between segments.
- <Kbd>Backspace</Kbd> on an empty segment backs up and clears the previous one; <Kbd>Delete</Kbd> clears in place.
- Pasting distributes filtered characters from the focused segment.
